    "raw_output": "function firstMinPerKey(keys, scores) {\n  if (keys.length !== scores.length) {\n    return null;\n  }\n  const result = [];\n  for (let i = 0; i < keys.length; i++) {\n    const key = keys[i];\n    let minScore = Infinity;\n    let minIndex = -1;\n    for (let j = 0; j < scores.length; j++) {\n      if (scores[j] < minScore || (scores[j] === minScore && minIndex === -1 || j < minIndex)) {\n        minScore = scores[j];\n        minIndex = j;\n      }\n    }\n    if (minIndex !== -1) {\n      result.push(minIndex);\n    }\n  }\n  return result.length > 0 ? result : null;\n}\n\nmodule.exports = { firstMinPerKey };<|im_end|>",
